{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbs","name":"Biblica® 圣经当代译本开放资源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBS","englishName":"Mandarin Chinese Open Contemporary Bible (Simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"74bf453a33641322ae4ddd23e051ee64d1412722972e541371ef97308285fe7d","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"HOS","translationId":"cmn_cbs","name":"何西阿书","commonName":"何西阿书","title":"何西阿书","order":28,"numberOfChapters":14,"sha256":"0fd01139d1173aab3c4eae9aadc1f8604860ccbde5e4b3d2c68eec56323410c3","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/HOS/1.json","lastChapterNumber":14,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/HOS/14.json","totalNumberOfVerses":197},"chapter":{"number":7,"content":[{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":[{"text":"当我要医治以色列的时候，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以法莲的罪就显露出来，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"撒玛利亚","poem":1},{"noteId":13},{"text":"的恶就暴露出来。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们行事诡诈；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"盗贼进屋偷窃，强盗外出抢劫。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们没有想到我记得他们的所有恶行。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"如今他们的罪恶环绕他们，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"都暴露在我面前。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们以罪恶取悦君王，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以谎言讨好首领。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们都是通奸之徒","poem":1},{"noteId":14},{"text":"，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"就像燃烧的火炉，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"从揉面到面团发起，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"烤饼的人不用挑旺炉火。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"君王宴乐的时候，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"首领们醉酒成病，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"君王也与轻慢上帝的人联手。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们的心如火炉，酝酿着阴谋。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们的怒气整夜冒烟，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"早晨爆发出熊熊烈焰。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们都像炙热的火炉，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"吞灭他们的首领。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们的君王都倒地而亡，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"没有一个向我求救。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"text":"“以法莲与外族人混杂，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"就像没有翻过的饼","poem":1},{"noteId":15},{"text":"。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"外族人耗尽了他的力量，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他却茫然不知。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他头发斑白，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"却浑然不觉。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以色列人被自己的傲慢指控，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们却不归向他们的上帝耶和华，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"也不去寻求祂。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以法莲像鸽子一样愚蠢无知，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们向埃及求救，又投奔亚述。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们去的时候，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要张网网住他们，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要像打落飞鸟一样打落他们。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要按他们的恶行","poem":1},{"noteId":16},{"text":"惩罚他们。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们有祸了，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为他们背弃我！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们要被毁灭了，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为他们背叛我！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要救赎他们，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们却向我撒谎。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们没有真心呼求我，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"只是在床上哭号。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们为求五谷和新酒而割伤自己，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"却背弃了我。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我训练他们，使他们臂膀强壮，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们却阴谋作恶抗拒我。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们回转，却不肯转向至高者，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们就像无用的弓。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们的首领要因出言狂妄而丧身刀下，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在埃及成为人们的笑柄。","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":13,"caller":"+","text":"“撒玛利亚”为北国以色列的首都，此处代指以色列。本卷书中下同。","reference":{"chapter":7,"verse":1}},{"noteId":14,"caller":"+","text":"“通奸之徒”此处指以色列人背弃耶和华，祭拜偶像。","reference":{"chapter":7,"verse":4}},{"noteId":15,"caller":"+","text":"“没有翻过的饼”指一面烤焦一面生的饼，不能食用，意义见下节。","reference":{"chapter":7,"verse":8}},{"noteId":16,"caller":"+","text":"“他们的恶行”希伯来文是“他们的会众所听到的”。","reference":{"chapter":7,"verse":12}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/HOS/7.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/HOS/8.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/HOS/6.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":16}